Description: FlickOS desktop environment (metapackage)
 Installs the complete FlickOS labwc desktop: compositor, panel,
 notifications, portals, PipeWire audio, networking, Bluetooth, printing,
 automatic security updates and default applications (Firefox ESR,
 LibreOffice, VLC, Mousepad, Ristretto, Evince, Xarchiver, GNOME PackageKit).
